["<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">curl</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">-fsSL</span><span class=\"token plain\"> https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/install.sh </span><span class=\"token operator\">|</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">bash</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">iex (irm https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/install.ps1) </span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">source</span><span class=\"token plain\"> ~/.bashrc   </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># or source ~/.zshrc</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes model</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes setup </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--portal</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes config </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> model anthropic/claude-opus-4.6</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes config </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> terminal.backend </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">docker</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes config </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> OPENROUTER_API_KEY sk-or-</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">..</span><span class=\"token plain\">.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes            </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># classic CLI</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--tui</span><span class=\"token plain\">      </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># modern TUI (recommended)</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Summarize this repo in 5 bullets and tell me what the main entrypoint is.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Check my current directory and tell me what looks like the main project file.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Help me set up a clean GitHub PR workflow for this codebase.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--continue</span><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Resume the most recent session</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">-c</span><span class=\"token plain\">            </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Short form</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">❯ What&#x27;s my disk usage? Show the top 5 largest directories.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes gateway setup    </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Interactive platform configuration</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes config </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> terminal.backend </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">docker</span><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Docker isolation</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes config </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> terminal.backend </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">ssh</span><span class=\"token plain\">       </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Remote server</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># From the Hermes install directory (the curl installer placed it at</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># ~/.hermes/hermes-agent on Linux/macOS or %LOCALAPPDATA%\\hermes\\hermes-agent on Windows):</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">cd</span><span class=\"token plain\"> ~/.hermes/hermes-agent</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">uv pip </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">install</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--python</span><span class=\"token plain\"> ./venv/bin/python </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">-e</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;.[voice]&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Includes faster-whisper for free local speech-to-text</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes skills browse                      </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># list everything available</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes skills search kubernetes           </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># find skills by keyword</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes skills </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">install</span><span class=\"token plain\"> openai/skills/k8s   </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># install one (runs a security scan first)</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">/k8s deploy the staging manifest          </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># run the skill with a request</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">/k8s                                       </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># load it and let Hermes ask what you need</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Add to ~/.hermes/config.yaml</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token key atrule\">mcp_servers</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">github</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">command</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> npx</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">args</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">[</span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;-y&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;@modelcontextprotocol/server-github&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">]</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">env</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">      </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;ghp_xxx&quot;</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes acp</span><br></div></code></pre>","<svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.5 0C3.48 0 1 2.19 1 5c0 .92.55 2.25 1 3 1.34 2.25 1.78 2.78 2 4v1h5v-1c.22-1.22.66-1.75 2-4 .45-.75 1-2.08 1-3 0-2.81-2.48-5-5.5-5zm3.64 7.48c-.25.44-.47.8-.67 1.11-.86 1.41-1.25 2.06-1.45 3.23-.02.05-.02.11-.02.17H5c0-.06 0-.13-.02-.17-.2-1.17-.59-1.83-1.45-3.23-.2-.31-.42-.67-.67-1.11C2.44 6.78 2 5.65 2 5c0-2.2 2.02-4 4.5-4 1.22 0 2.36.42 3.22 1.19C10.55 2.94 11 3.94 11 5c0 .66-.44 1.78-.86 2.48zM4 14h5c-.23 1.14-1.3 2-2.5 2s-2.27-.86-2.5-2z\"></path></svg>","<svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.5 0C3.48 0 1 2.19 1 5c0 .92.55 2.25 1 3 1.34 2.25 1.78 2.78 2 4v1h5v-1c.22-1.22.66-1.75 2-4 .45-.75 1-2.08 1-3 0-2.81-2.48-5-5.5-5zm3.64 7.48c-.25.44-.47.8-.67 1.11-.86 1.41-1.25 2.06-1.45 3.23-.02.05-.02.11-.02.17H5c0-.06 0-.13-.02-.17-.2-1.17-.59-1.83-1.45-3.23-.2-.31-.42-.67-.67-1.11C2.44 6.78 2 5.65 2 5c0-2.2 2.02-4 4.5-4 1.22 0 2.36.42 3.22 1.19C10.55 2.94 11 3.94 11 5c0 .66-.44 1.78-.86 2.48zM4 14h5c-.23 1.14-1.3 2-2.5 2s-2.27-.86-2.5-2z\"></path></svg>","<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z\"></path></svg>","<svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.13